{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_01_end","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_01","title":"初醒","storyCode":"WR-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"8172f19c8ed4fa193ae6cdfbace81e204a51ad8c57ed34f60fa2c6b7464715ef","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這些東西......是什麼？感染生物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有發現感染的跡象喔......而且說是生物，射穿它們的時候，它們就變成黑色的水漬消失了欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......某種法術？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣下去不行，數量太多了......得找出源頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"它們是從哪個方向進入城鎮的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"視野越來越暗了哦，小炎熔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"還要追嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是怎麼來到這裡的還不清楚......情況有點詭異，我不太建議現在過於深入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這可能是個線索啦，但也不用這麼著急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"二位恩、恩人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你怎麼跟來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼話！怎麼能拋下恩人自已跑路呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道那些東西是什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我也沒見過啊......你看我腿都在打顫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不是某種......炎國特產對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能！這些奇形怪狀的東西要是滿地跑，早就變成轟動全國的大新聞了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......克洛絲，烏有，聽我說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我“完全記不得”推開那茅屋木門之後發生的事情，等到回過神來，就已經在那園林裡聽那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"煮傘居士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"對，聽那個煮傘居士說故事了。我對自己是怎麼來到這裡的一點印象都沒有。以及，我也不知道這裡是哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，有件事我倒是能確定，這裡不是泥翁鎮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我也有幾年沒去過泥翁鎮，但這裡的風土人情未免復古了些，剛才我一路跑過來，連個電纜都沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那更麻煩了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"就像做夢一樣呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道你在想什麼，但是現在，我們沒有其他辦法，只能信任彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？恩人！你可別不信我啊！我絕不是那忘恩負義之徒！再說我也沒那麼大能耐啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是這個意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是考慮到目前的情況，這一切都太詭異了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有不相信小烏有你哦，只是必須冷靜下來想想各種各樣的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"大概還是某種陷阱吧，那麼眼前這一切是不是真的......都很難說了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人呐，別看我長得年輕，風流倜儻，但我年紀多半還是比你大的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"源石技藝......也有可能。但難度太大了。是連通到了某個地方？還是乾脆給我們施展了幻象......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"二位恩人果然是奇人呐，一般人遇到這種情況，哪能瞬間考慮到這個方向......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"“一般人”呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道這裡是哪裡，但這裡的地理情況太過反常......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"日月的位置相對固定，住房大都建在靠著黑夜的這一側，農田和集市則在那邊......但本地人似乎完全習以為常，還有剛才那些東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要情報。越快越好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"鐘又響了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"只有在大炎和東國才能聽到這種撞鐘的聲響呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗獷的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"鐘響了，響了！大伙們，沒事了！都沒事了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗獷的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"沒見到那些玩意的蹤跡啦！我看到那幾個外人幫我們趕走了那些怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"他們竟然不怕那些玩意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗獷的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"依我看，我們就該一鼓作氣，打到那山裡去，斬草除根！動不動就來上一遭，煩死人了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"話別這麼說，不要太為難人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗獷的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，先生......您回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"逸川，你立刻去找那三位英雄，請他們務必來我這裡敘上一敘。先前怠慢了他們，現在可得好好答謝一番。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗獷的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀哎呀，小僧果然還是適合這撞鐘的工作呀！住持爺爺要是知道小僧遠在他鄉還如此勤勉，一定會倍感欣慰的吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"嵯峨！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦，掌櫃的，你怎麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到鐘聲了，都結束了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"聽逸川叔說，有幾位遠道而來的客人幫忙保護了鎮子，你有瞧見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"沒呢，小僧不是一直在這守著鐘嗎？不過要是像小僧的寺裡那樣有座鐘樓，說不定還能遠眺一番。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，小僧來這裡也有段時日了，這還是第一次見到那些墨魎弄出如此大陣仗，如此巧合？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才想請你去見見那些外鄉人呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["？？？","嵯峨"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["烏有"]}]}
